  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: thebeansbecomespilt
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236574
    - rid: 1790118649019236576
    - rid: 1790118649019236577
    - rid: 1790118649019236579
    - rid: 1790118649019236580
    - rid: 1790118649019236581
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}, we''re back!'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236582
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: At Monika's call, {mc} emerges from his room.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236583
    - rid: 1790118649019236584
    - rid: 1790118649019236585
    - rid: 1790118649019236586
    - rid: 1790118649019236587
    - rid: 1790118649019236589
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}, you look like crap! Have you eaten at all today?'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118649019236590
    - rid: 1790118649019236591
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Nah, I didn't really feel hungry.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506881
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Is your stomach upset or something, {mc}?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506880
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: No.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506882
    - rid: 1790118673552506883
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Um, there was something we needed to talk about as a group, right?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506884
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506885
    - rid: 1790118673552506886
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Look-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506887
    - rid: 1790118673552506888
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: None of this is real; not this world, not me, and not any of you.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506889
    - rid: 1790118673552506897
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506890
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: This is all just some game, us being here is just for the entertainment
      of an actually real person.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506893
    - rid: 1790118673552506895
    - rid: 1790118673552506896
    - rid: 1790118673552506898
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506894
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: You-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506910
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: You can't be serious!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506901
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I am; Monika is too, isn't she?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506902
    - rid: 1790118673552506904
    - rid: 1790118673552506905
    - rid: 1790118673552506911
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: What could you have possibly seen to make you think that?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506903
    - rid: 1790118673552506912
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I saw the player <i>and</i> spoke to the person who orchestrated our
      lives-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506906
    - rid: 1790118673552506907
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Or rather, who orchestrated these past two weeks, since our lives before
      that are quite literally <i>just</i> memories.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506908
    - rid: 1790118673552506909
    - rid: 1790118673552506965
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: That's-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506966
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Prove it! Prove you spoke to this player or whatever!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506967
    - rid: 1790118673552506968
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506969
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506970
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506973
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506976
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552506984
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: That's-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307161
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: This is <NoiseText=3,1>bullshit</NoiseText>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307162
    - rid: 1790118692274307163
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: ... when viewed through the lens of narrative, our group is a bit cliche,
      isn't it?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307164
    - rid: 1790118692274307165
    - rid: 1790118692274307167
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: The queen bee, the friendly ditz, the cute mean girl, and a shy bookworm...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307168
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: You're taking this seriously, Yuri?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307169
    - rid: 1790118692274307171
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Well... yes.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307170
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Everything being just a game for some player makes way more sense than
      real people somehow finding themselves trapped in a video game world.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307173
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: What about you, Sayori? You can't be buying any of this, can you?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307174
    - rid: 1790118692274307175
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307176
    - rid: 1790118692274307178
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't want to believe it...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307177
    - rid: 1790118692274307179
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm not even supposed to be here; the person who manipulated all of this
      had me replace the original {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307180
    - rid: 1790118692274307181
    - rid: 1790118692274307182
    - rid: 1790118692274307183
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait, wait, wait, replaced {mc} when?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307184
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: The Monday before he joined our club, so you never knew the original
      {mc}, Natsuki.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307186
    - rid: 1790118692274307187
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm not sure if that's better or not...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307188
    - rid: 1790118692274307189
    - rid: 1790118692274307190
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ... no...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307191
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah. I know, Sayori...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307193
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: That- no, but you act like {mc}, whenever I think of {mc}, I see you-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Close your eyes, Sayori.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307194
    - rid: 1790118714061094912
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Think of the earliest memory you have with me, get as clear of a picture
      of me as a child in your head.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: What color are my eyes, Sayori?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ... Yellow-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: -!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307195
    - rid: 1790118714061094913
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'And there you have it: not me.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307196
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: The only reason I was able to become friends with you people is just
      a lie.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307197
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118692274307200
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Um...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061094966
    - rid: 1790118714061094974
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: S-so now what?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061094967
    - rid: 1790118714061094968
    - rid: 1790118714061094969
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: What do you mean now what? There's nothing.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061094970
    - rid: 1790118714061094971
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I wouldn't say there's <i>nothing</i> we could do-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061094972
    - rid: 1790118714061094973
    - rid: 1790118714061094975
    - rid: 1790118714061094976
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Quit fooling yourself, Monika.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061094977
    - rid: 1790118714061094979
    - rid: 1790118714061094980
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: The thing that's been orchestrating our lives-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I've been calling it the entity...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061094981
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... The entity has complete control over us; if it wanted to wipe our
      memories of this, it could.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061094982
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So there's nothing we can do; we're... fucked.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061094983
    - rid: 1790118714061094984
    - rid: 1790118714061094985
    - rid: 1790118714061094986
    - rid: 1790118714061094987
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: With that... bombshell, the group remains silent for a minute.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc} starts making his way to the door outside.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061094988
    - rid: 1790118714061094989
    - rid: 1790118714061094990
    - rid: 1790118714061094991
    - rid: 1790118714061094992
    - rid: 1790118714061094993
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori grabs onto {mc}'s arm just as he's about to leave-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061094994
    - rid: 1790118714061094995
    - rid: 1790118714061094996
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: W-where are you going?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061094997
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... nowhere in particular; like I said, there's nothing we can do, anyway.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061094998
    - rid: 1790118714061095004
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc} gently gets Sayori to let go of him and leaves.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061094999
    - rid: 1790118714061095000
    - rid: 1790118714061095001
    - rid: 1790118714061095002
    - rid: 1790118714061095003
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori just stares at the door...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095005
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095006
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Monika seems to be thinking something, but doesn't want to interrupt
      the mood too soon.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095023
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Okay, you three-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095024
    - rid: 1790118714061095025
    - rid: 1790118714061095026
    - rid: 1790118714061095027
    - rid: 1790118714061095028
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Just because {mc}'s given up doesn't mean I have.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095029
    - rid: 1790118714061095030
    - rid: 1790118714061095031
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: B-but... {mc} said that entity could wipe our minds and stuff-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095032
    - rid: 1790118714061095033
    - rid: 1790118714061095034
    - rid: 1790118714061095035
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: What are we supposed to do against that?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095036
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm not saying that the entity can't do that, it probably can.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095038
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: What I <i>am</i> saying, is that we have reason to believe our situation
      isn't completely hopeless.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095037
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: First, and perhaps most importantly, we are in a <i>game</i>-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095039
    - rid: 1790118714061095040
    - rid: 1790118714061095041
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: That means if we somehow find access to the code, files, assets, whatever,
      we'd be able to manipulate our situation-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Probably the same way the entity does.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095042
    - rid: 1790118714061095043
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Second, the entity doesn't seem to want us dead; it seems mostly interested
      in telling a good story.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095044
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: We don't have to worry about getting deleted out of existence or anything-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: This means that we can basically act with impunity, because...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Third, we know that the entity isn't omniscient.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095045
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: The fact that {mc} was able to tell us that everything was just a game
      at all, without getting his mind wiped during the process, speaks volumes,
      doesn't it?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095047
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Fourth, even <i>if</i> the entity managed to wipe all of our minds at
      the same time-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095048
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: His lack of omniscience means we could leave ourselves clues or notes.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: And if we can't do that, <b>the player</b> would still remember.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait, how and why would <b>the player</b> help us?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095049
    - rid: 1790118714061095050
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095051
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: So how are we supposed to get access to the code, then?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095057
    - rid: 1790118714061095058
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Without that, we'd still be powerless- even without our previous ignorant
      bliss.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095059
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: If I knew the answer to that, we probably wouldn't be having this conversation-
      or be stuck here in Skyrim...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095060
    - rid: 1790118714061095061
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: If this world still operates like the one we're originally from, there
      should be sequence and asset files-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095062
    - rid: 1790118714061095063
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait, how do you know about that?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095064
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, see, back home I had access to them-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095065
    - rid: 1790118714061095066
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Something to do with being the president of the club.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095067
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: What does being the president of some literature club have to do with
      having access to files and stuff?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095068
    - rid: 1790118714061095069
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, our game was <i>supposed</i> to just be a dating sim-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095070
    - rid: 1790118714061095071
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: So I guess I was supposed to give detailed information on how the player
      is doing based on what's going on behind the scenes.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095072
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Today's been a lot...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095073
    - rid: 1790118714061095075
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: And we're not even half-way through with it yet, ahaha!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095074
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Anyway, some people and things seem to be more aware of the reality
      of this place than others:'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095076
    - rid: 1790118714061095077
    - rid: 1790118714061095078
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Obviously, {mc} knows the most out of anybody here that I know of-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095080
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: But the dragons and Dwemer seem to have had more awareness of their situation,
      and I met a guy who was crazy because he knew too much.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095081
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: So I think we could figure <i>something</i> out if we kept digging.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095082
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Okay, but how are we supposed to find these people who know?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095083
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (That'd be a lot easier if {mc} was still here.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095084
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I guess people who know about the Dwemer and the history of this place
      more broadly would be the place to start.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095085
    - rid: 1790118714061095086
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Okay, but how do we find <i>them</i>, prez?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095087
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, uh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095088
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Since Sayori and Yuri attend one of the few colleges here, I'm sure they
      could network pretty effectively-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095089
    - rid: 1790118714061095091
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: And since you're with the Companions, your work can take you around Skyrim,
      yeah?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095090
    - rid: 1790118714061095092
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: So you'd be able to ask around the places you go, even if they seem unassuming
      at first.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095093
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: So...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Just keep doing what we've been doing, but ask around about Dwemer, dragons,
      and smart people in general?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095094
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ... when you put it like that, it sounds a little silly.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095095
    - rid: 1790118714061095096
    - rid: 1790118714061095097
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: But yeah, I think that's our best option for now.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095098
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Um-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095102
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: What should we do about {mc}?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095099
    - rid: 1790118714061095100
    - rid: 1790118714061095101
    - rid: 1790118714061095103
    - rid: 1790118714061095104
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095105
    - rid: 1790118714061095106
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Do <b>you</b> know where he is?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095107
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: I've been with you guys the whole time, so I don't know.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095108
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Alright...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, we don't know where he is; which isn't good.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095109
    - rid: 1790118714061095110
    - rid: 1790118714061095111
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Especially since he would be really helpful for this wild goose chase-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095112
    - rid: 1790118714061095115
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: But, it's been- what, a handful of minutes since he left?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095113
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: It's not like he could be <i>anywhere</i> right now, but we wouldn't
      be able to just find him by just looking around here.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095114
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Especially if <b>you</b> can't get an eye on him.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095116
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: So... I guess {mc} will have to be included in our list of targets.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095117
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095118
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095119
    - rid: 1790118714061095120
    - rid: 1790118714061095121
    - rid: 1790118714061095122
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095123
    - rid: 1790118714061095124
    - rid: 1790118714061095125
    - rid: 1790118714061095126
    - rid: 1790118714061095137
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, then-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095127
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori heads out through the door she was staring at just a few minutes
      ago.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095128
    - rid: 1790118714061095129
    - rid: 1790118714061095130
    - rid: 1790118714061095132
    - rid: 1790118714061095133
    - rid: 1790118714061095134
    - rid: 1790118714061095136
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I guess she's going after {mc}...?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095138
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Pft. Figures.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095139
    - rid: 1790118714061095140
    - rid: 1790118714061095141
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ... any questions, comments, concerns?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095142
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: U-um...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Yes, Yuri?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095143
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I've learned of a way to teleport.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: You what?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095144
    - rid: 1790118714061095145
    - rid: 1790118714061095146
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: It works by marking a specific place in space that I can then recall
      to later.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095147
    - rid: 1790118714061095148
    - rid: 1790118714061095149
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Which, as of now, would be back in Winterhold.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095150
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Can you set up multiple places to recall to?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095151
    - rid: 1790118714061095152
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: As of now, no.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095153
    - rid: 1790118714061095154
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm not sure if having multiple marks personally is even possible-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095155
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: It is currently possible to circumvent this limitation by enchanting
      an item to "hold" the knowledge of the mark-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095157
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: But I'm still a novice in that area, so it would take some time to be
      able to do that.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095156
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ... neat!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095158
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I've, uh, got nothing else for you guys.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095159
    - rid: 1790118714061095160
    - rid: 1790118714061095161
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, okay. Goodbye, you two.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095162
    - rid: 1790118714061095163
    - rid: 1790118714061095164
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ... bye-?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095165
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095167
    - rid: 1790118714061095166
    - rid: 1790118714061095169
    - rid: 1790118714061095170
    - rid: 1790118714061095171
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I guess it's just you and me, Natsuki.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095172
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I should probably get back to Whiterun-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095173
    - rid: 1790118714061095174
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I've got a guild to run, after all.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095175
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095181
    - rid: 1790118714061095182
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Isn't someone helping you with that, though?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095176
    - rid: 1790118714061095177
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: You're just mad I got a promotion before you did.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095178
    - rid: 1790118714061095179
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm not even sure what I would be able to get promoted to; I'm already
      a captain of the guard.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095183
    - rid: 1790118714061095187
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095188
    - rid: 1790118714061095190
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Maybe I swap from police duties to military ones and become a general?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095189
    - rid: 1790118714061095191
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Get into politics, see where that takes me?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095192
    - rid: 1790118714061095193
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095194
    - rid: 1790118714061095196
    - rid: 1790118714061095198
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: So are you just gonna fall me all the way back to Jorrvaskr, or...?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095199
    - rid: 1790118714061095200
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095203
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, uh, I should probably check in with the Jarl and just do what he
      tells me, ahaha...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095201
    - rid: 1790118714061095202
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, I'll be seeing you around town, then.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095205
    - rid: 1790118714061095207
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki takes the right turn to Jorrvaskr, while Monika stays on her
      course to Dragonsreach.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095204
    - rid: 1790118714061095206
    - rid: 1790118714061095208
    - rid: 1790118714061095210
